abstract:
We prove the sixth-symmetric-power case of Foulkes' conjecture. For every integer b ≥ 6 and every finite-dimensional complex vector space V, there is a $\mathop{\mathrm{GL}}
olimits (V)$-equivariant injection $\mathop{\mathrm{Sym}}
olimits ^6(\mathop{\mathrm{Sym}}
olimits ^b V)\hookrightarrow\mathop{\mathrm{Sym}}
olimits ^b(\mathop{\mathrm{Sym}}
olimits ^6 V)$.
